OL,3,AHunger Games fan, 13, to get artwork   
OL,4,Ashown on cinema screens before film    
OL,6,FA teenage Hunger Games fan has met the 
OL,7,Fcast of the new film after her artwork 
OL,8,Fwon a competition, meaning it will be  
OL,9,Fdisplayed at every cinema screening    
OL,10,Facross the UK.                         
OL,12,FFreja Brown, 13, won the British Board 
OL,13,Fof Film Classification's (BBFC) create 
OL,14,Fthe card competition, which ran ahead  
OL,15,Fof the release of The Hunger Games:    
OL,16,FSunrise on the Reaping - the sixth film
OL,17,Fin the franchise.                      
OL,19,FFreja, from Cardiff, beat more than    
OL,20,F1,000 entries from across the UK and   
OL,21,Fsaid she was "so grateful" to be       
OL,22,Fchosen.                                
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
