OL,3,AHunger Games fan, 13, to get artwork   
OL,4,Ashown on cinema screens before film    
OL,6,FHer design will be the official BBFC   
OL,7,Fblack card, which displays the age     
OL,8,Frating and classification details of   
OL,9,Fthe film before every cinema showing.  
